  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2018-09-24T17:03:48.622Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "I've been using the beta client for a little bit now and thew one thing that frustrates me is that I cannot easily discern where my friends are at a distance. In maps like the box as the friends icon is so small it is literally impossible to pick them out in a group of nameplates so I have to go manually check each group until i find them. It's a small issue but one that has made it harder to find my friends and is currently the only major issue i have with the new UI.",
